---
import { sitePath } from '../lib/sitePath';
import onlinePaymentImage from '../../assets/Hand Holding AltPayNet Payment Phone and Cards.png';
---
<section class="payments-section section-shell" aria-labelledby="payments-title" data-reveal>
  <div class="section-heading payment-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Payments with AltPayNet</span><h2 id="payments-title">Flexible ways to complete an order.</h2></div><p>Support familiar in-store and online payment paths through the approved AltPayNet relationship, configured for the requirements of each deployment.</p></div>
  <div class="payment-grid">
    <article class="payment-card"><div class="payment-copy"><span class="card-label">In-store payments</span><h3>Terminal integration</h3><p>Connect a secure payment terminal to the kiosk checkout flow for supported card and in-store payment requirements.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/contact/')}>Discuss terminal requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="terminal-art terminal-art--image">
      <img class="payment-terminal-image" src={sitePath('/assets/images/payment-terminal-v1-720.webp')}
        srcset={[360, 720, 1080].map(width => `${sitePath(`/assets/images/payment-terminal-v1-${width}.webp`)} ${width}w`).join(', ')}
        sizes="(max-width: 400px) calc(100vw - 64px), (max-width: 1180px) 360px, 24vw"
        width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
        alt="Illustrative Ez Kyosk countertop kiosk beside a payment terminal, showing a matching sample order total of 300 pesos" />
    </div></article>
    <article class="payment-card"><div class="payment-copy"><span class="card-label">Online payments</span><h3>QR and e-wallet checkout</h3><p>Let customers use supported QR, GCash, Maya, card, and e-wallet payment paths from a mobile device.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/contact/')}>Discuss online payments <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="phone-art phone-art--image">
      <img class="payment-online-image" src={onlinePaymentImage.src}
        width={onlinePaymentImage.width} height={onlinePaymentImage.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async"
        alt="Owner-supplied illustration of a hand holding an AltPayNet payment phone with QR, GCash, Maya, and card options" />
    </div></article>
  </div>
</section>
